esigner's \"constructions for the eye.\"\nContent provided by Syndetic Solutions, Inc. Terms of Use\n... ( see more )\n\n    Subjects\n    Location\n    Table of Contents\n    MARC\n    Full Record\n\nSubjects\nMayakovsky, Vladimir, 1893-1930. Dli͡a golosa.\nArtists' books -- Facsimiles.\nBinding method -- Paperback (machine-sewn)\nPrinting / production method -- Commercial production.\nArtists' books.\n\nOther Title: \tDli͡a golosa.\nDli͡a golosa. English.\nIncludes: \tMayakovsky, Vladimir, 1893-1930. Dli͡a golosa. English.\nMayakovsky, Vladimir, 1893-1930. Dli͡a golosa.\nOther Author: \tLissitzky, El, 1890-1941.\nMayakovsky, Vladimir, 1893-1930.\nRailing, Patricia.\nLocation\nOnline\nLocation \tCall # \tStatus \tNotes\nArt Library \tN7433.4.M59 D6 2000 v.1-3 \tIn-Library Use Only \t\nDavis Library (6 th floor) \tPG3476.M3 D5713 2000 v.1 \tDue 04/05/2015 \t\nDavis Library (6 th floor) \tPG3476.M3 D5713 2000 v.2 \tDue 04/05/2015 \t\nDavis Library (6 th floor) \tPG3476.M3 D5713 2000 v.3 \tDue 04/05/2015 \t\nTable of Contents\nv. 1. For the voice : a facsimile of the 1923 Russian edition / Vladimir Mayakovsky ; El Lissitzky, book constructor -- v. 2. For the voice / Vlaidimir [i.e. Vladimir] Mayakovsky ; El Lissitzky, book constructor ; English translation by Peter France ; visual translation by Martha Scotford -- v. 3. For the voice : voices of revolution : a collection of essays / edited by Patricia Railing.\nMARC\nLEADER 00000cam a2200481 a 4500 \n001    45805168 \n005    20010405140600.0 \n008    000302s2000    maua     b    001 0 eng   \n010       00028354 \n020    0262133776 (pbk. : set : alk. paper) \n020    071234666X (pbk. : v. 1 : alk. paper) \n020    0712346678 (pbk. : v. 2 : alk. paper) \n020    0712346694 (pbk. : v. 3 : alk. paper) \n040    DLC|cDLC|dNOC \n041 1  eng|arus|hrus \n050 00 PG3476.M3|bD5713 2000 \n100 1  Mayakovsky, Vladimir,|d1893-1930. \n245 10 For the voice /|cVladimir Mayakovsky and El Lissitzky. \n250    1st MIT Press ed. \n260    Cambrid